In this outputted code, a "Debug.Assert" statement is placed at the end of the `PUT_LastIndexOfContract` method. This statement is generated from the comment that directly precedes it ("@@@ If the return value is non-negative, size of old and new list is same"). The csharp code is now setup and ready to use "Debug.Assert" along with other Debug methods to generate assert statements that can be used for testing.--------------------